title: Milicja PPS
subtitle: Recruit, train, or reorganise the self-defence as Akcja Socjalistyczna.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_party_militia.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.militiaAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.militia (technical reference 13.3–13.4; card catalogue 5.2). Z — 0.89 (decisions 2A and 3A of 24 X 2026 and the
// user's note on the card): what the self-defence is for in plain words, its members and its training; no forces and no
// foretelling of events. Recruitment and training each wait two months; Akcja Socjalistyczna is a one-off reorganisation.
PolishParty.partyDisplay(Q);
Q.pl_mil_state = PolishParty.militiaCardLine(Q);
Q.pl_mil_recruit_why = PolishParty.militiaStatus(Q, 'recruit').reason;
Q.pl_mil_militarize_why = PolishParty.militiaStatus(Q, 'militarize').reason;
Q.pl_mil_as_why = PolishParty.militiaStatus(Q, 'as').reason;
!}

= Milicja PPS

The self-defence of the party protects strikes, meetings and the offices of our organisations, and if the conflict in the country turns sharp it can stand on the side the party chooses. [+ pl_mil_state +]

- @recruit
- @militarize
- @form_as
- @easy_discard

@recruit
title: Carry out a recruitment
subtitle: One unit of the party's money: the Milicja gains 150 members, up to 800. The next recruitment in two months.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.militiaStatus(Q, 'recruit').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_mil_recruit_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.militiaChoose(Q, 'recruit');
!}
go-to: result

@militarize
title: Carry out a training
subtitle: One unit of the party's money: the training rises by one level. The first training worries the Centre of PPS: its dissent rises (+3). The next training in two months.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.militiaStatus(Q, 'militarize').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_mil_militarize_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.militiaChoose(Q, 'militarize');
!}
go-to: result

@form_as
title: Reorganise as Akcja Socjalistyczna
subtitle: Two units of the party's money, once: a stronger and more disciplined organisation that can protect three matters at once. Needs 500 members and training at level 3.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.militiaStatus(Q, 'as').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_mil_as_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.militiaChoose(Q, 'as');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Milicja PPS

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.
